      "value": "<p>At 18th level, the astrologian creates a 20-ft.-radius dome over herself, centered on her. It lasts a number of rounds equal to her Wisdom modifier, and while inside the dome, the astrologian and her allies gain Fast Healing equal to half of her astrologian levels and damage is reduced by 50%. The astrologian must concentrate on this ability as a full-round action each round otherwise the ability stops. This ability is usable only once per day, even if it ended prematurely.</p>",
